# Next.js Example — USDC Payments SDK Demo

This is a complete working example of how to integrate the USDC Payments SDK for Stellar into a Next.js application.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+ 
- npm or yarn
- Freighter wallet extension (for browser testing)

### Installation & Setup

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start development server
npm run dev
```

Visit [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) to see the demo.

### Backend Simulation

To test the **Secure Server Verification**, run the included simulation script:

```bash
# Build the project first
npm run build

# Run the secure server example
node secure-server-example.mjs
```

This script simulates:
1. A Merchant Server (listening for webhooks).
2. A Payment Monitor (watching the blockchain).
3. A Client Application (creating a payment intent).

---

